/-!
# Stage P1 `load_session` Step over `trTrapProgAt`

Proves `stageP1_load_ok_kit_trap` (`img.base + kit.loadShimOff → img.base + ikit.trustShimOff`)
over `trTrapProgAt img.base C abs` and `SessionOnlyKitOkSE`, preserving `calleeSavedVRegs` for
both `opt = none` and `opt = some r`.
-/

public section

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace CryptoVerification.Cli.E2E.Pqxdh.ResponderClosure.Kits

open Arm64 ProofLib ProofLib.ProgramReflection
open CryptoGames CryptoGames.LibsignalSession CryptoGames.LibsignalSessionApi
